      "description": "<p>The first time each round a creature takes damage from the paleohemoth's jaws, the target must attempt a DC 32 Fortitude Saving Throw save. If it fails and has not already been slowed by this ability, it becomes Slowed 1 for 1 minute.</p>\n<p>If the creature was already slowed by this ability, a failed save causes it to be Petrified permanently.</p>",
